>Is it possible to see a clover, even if your luck is already maxed out?

  No.  There are ways to reduce your luck: break a mirror, jump in
Sokoban, break a boulder in Sokoban, etc.  A subsequent sacrifice will
then increase your luck.

> How much does seeing a clover actually affect your luck, anyhow?

  It depends on the monster sacrificed.  Section 7 of the praying
spoiler gives the luck gain per monster difficulty.  It also has a link
to the spoiler that lists monster difficulty.

  Players performing extended sacrifests "tune" their luck.  This can
reduce/remove the chance of being crowned.  It can also increase the
chance of receiving divine protection.




